2. Object meshes generated with SAM 3D Objects (data/objects/)
===============================================================================

The following object meshes were reconstructed with Meta's SAM 3D Objects
model and then processed for use in LEGS. None of them is stored in git;
scripts/download_assets.sh fetches them.

From the core assets (LEGS-core-assets.tar.gz, hosted on Google Drive):

  data/objects/high_table.glb             data/objects/high_table.stl
  data/objects/high_table_blue_raw.glb    data/objects/high_table_blue_raw.stl
  data/objects/mid_table.glb              data/objects/mid_table.stl
  data/objects/mid_table_wood_raw.glb     data/objects/mid_table_wood_raw.stl
  data/objects/orange.glb                 data/objects/orange.stl
  data/objects/plate.glb                  data/objects/plate.stl
  data/objects/<name>/<name>_col_*.stl    collision parts of high_table,
                                          mid_table, orange and plate

From the LEGS asset repository on Hugging Face
(https://huggingface.co/datasets/hojjunekim/LEGS-assets):

  data/objects/orange_hdr.glb             data/objects/plate_hdr.glb
  data/objects/apple.glb                  data/objects/box.glb
  data/objects/sources/<object>/mesh_raw.glb   (apple, box, orange, plate)

